# era-bank module map

Port **3210**. Ops satellite — **no ledger in `era_bank` DB**.

## Auth

| Path | Notes |
|------|-------|
| `/login` | Local ops users — SHARED `orgNo` (ERA ID), Host bind, JWT UUID |
| `GET /api/auth/login` | Host-binding hint (`hostBound`) |
| `/sso/callback` | Owner SSO from orchestrator (ticket UUID) |

## Ops UI

| Path | BFF |
|------|-----|
| `/cif` | `/api/cif/*` |
| `/accounts` | `/api/accounts/*` |
| `/postings/queue` | `/api/postings/*` |
| `/payments` | `/api/payments/*` |
| `/deposits`, `/loans` | module proxies (`?pendingPricing=1` queue; pricing-approve/reject) |
| `/risk`, `/risk/portfolio`, `/risk/collateral`, `/risk/ecl`, `/risk/capital` | `/api/risk/*` |
| `/aml/alerts` | `/api/aml/*` |
| `/reports/cbar` | `/api/reports/*` |
| `/cards`, `/card-txns` | `/api/cards/*`, `/api/card-txns/*` |
| `/treasury` | `/api/treasury/*` |
| `/admin/branches`, `/admin/product-factory`, `/admin/eod` | admin proxies |
| `/admin/access` | `/api/admin/roles`, `…/permissions`, `/api/admin/users`, refresh-permissions — Variant A (`admin:access_manage` + `screen:admin.access`) |
| `/cash` | `/api/cash/*` (`banking_cash`) |
| `/fees` | `/api/fees/*` (tariffs / SDB / packages) |
| `/payments/extras` | `/api/payments/standing-orders|virtual-accounts|cheques|sweep-rules` |
| `/collections` | `/api/collections/*` (`banking_collections`) |
| `/trade` | `/api/trade/*` (`banking_trade`) |
| `/islamic` | `/api/islamic/*` (`banking_islamic`) |
| `/wealth` | `/api/wealth/*` (`banking_wealth`) |
| `/loans/applications`, `/loans/credit-lines` | `/api/loans/applications`, `/api/loans/credit-lines` |
| `/aml/cases` | `/api/aml/cases` |
| `/cards/disputes`, `/cards/3ds` | `/api/cards/disputes*`, `/api/cards/3ds/*` |

Entitlement gate: `industry_banking` + per-module `banking_*`.

## Internal (orchestrator Sync)

| Path | Notes |
|------|-------|
| `POST/GET /api/internal/v1/organization/bind` | Org UUID bind (Bearer `SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN`); kit persist + boot hydrate |
| `POST/GET /api/internal/v1/runtime-config` | Desired-state runtime config (SSO, event token, activeModules); kit persist + boot hydrate |
